      "formula": "w = \\frac{\\hat{p} + \\frac{z^2}{2n} \\pm z \\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})}{n} + \\frac{z^2}{4n^2}}}{1 + \\frac{z^2}{n}}",
